284
00:23:42,216 --> 00:23:46,553
The same is true in a different way in Julius Caesar . John , go ahead , please .

285
00:23:52,685 --> 00:23:54,144
uh ...

286
00:23:54,687 --> 00:24:00,233
In the most high and palmy state of Rome , a little ere the mightiest Julius fell .

287
00:24:00,401 --> 00:24:03,320
The graves stood tenantless , and the sheeted dead

288
