570
00:52:18,503 --> 00:52:21,464
I don 't know where you found it or what you 're trying to prove ...

571
00:52:21,632 --> 00:52:26,052
What I learned in the dream clinic , that 's what I 'm trying to prove , Mother .

572
00:52:26,637 --> 00:52:31,307
Rod didn 't kill Tina , and he didn 't hang himself .

573
00:52:32,185 --> 00:52:33,769
It 's this guy .

574
00:52:34,979 --> 00:52:37,314
