587
00:53:12,850 --> 00:53:16,853
Or maybe I should grab that bottle and veg out with you .

588
00:53:17,021 --> 00:53:20,732
Avoid everything happening to me by just getting good and loaded .

589
00:53:28,158 --> 00:53:30,910
