719
01:05:36,482 --> 01:05:38,108
Just a minute .

720
01:05:38,276 --> 01:05:43,321
She says it 's private , very private and very important .

721
01:05:43,489 --> 01:05:46,950
Give me that . Glen 's asleep . You 'll have to talk to him tomorrow .

722
01:05:47,118 --> 01:05:50,078
You 've just gotta be firm with these kids , that 's all . Let 's go .

723
