I locked it all up . I had to .

739
01:07:49,367 --> 01:07:54,079
Nancy , you are going to get some sleep tonight if it kills me .

740
01:07:54,247 --> 01:07:57,082
Give me the key , Mother .

741
01:07:57,250 --> 01:08:01,087
