COP : You won 't need a stretcher up there . You 'll need a mop .

754
01:09:17,999 --> 01:09:20,417
MEDIC : Let 's go . Let 's go .

755
01:09:22,921 --> 01:09:24,546
MAN : Hey !

756
01:09:26,174 --> 01:09:27,800
THOMPSON : Don 't tell me it 's another one .

757
